  "business_rules": [
    "Stock must not be directly edited.",
    "Every stock-changing operation must be traceable.",
    "Historical movements should not be casually deleted; corrections should use controlled reversal/correction movements.",
    "Negative stock behavior must be explicitly controlled.",
    "Expired stock must be distinguishable and not silently treated as sellable.",
    "Locked batches must be protected by backend validation.",
    "Stock synchronization must be transaction based rather than last-write-wins stock replacement."
